Looking at the working files, I need to create a `VibeCodingHeader` component that:
1. Manages branch selection (current branch + target/compare branch)
2. Creates new branches
3. Stores branch info in the chat's `meta_data`
4. Initializes from existing chat `meta_data`

```vue client/src/components/vibe/VibeCodingHeader.vue
<script setup>
import BranchSelector from '@/components/git/BranchSelector.vue'
</script>

<template>
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-base-200 border-b border-base-content/10 text-xs shrink-0">
    <!-- Vibe indicator -->
    <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-success font-mono shrink-0">
